></div>\n\n\n            </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"gc-srvinfo col-md-8 pull-left\">\n                <div class=\"mwsdoormat-links-container section\">\n\n<h2>Services and information</h2><div class=\"wb-eqht row wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-8\">\n\n\t\n        \n        \n        \n         \n        \n                 \n        \n        \n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 221px;\">\n        \t\t\n<section class=\"gc-drmt\"><h2 data-emptytext=\"Enter heading\" class=\"h5\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/en/security-intelligence-service/corporate/csis-jobs.html\">CSIS Jobs</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<p>Learn more about job opportunities at CSIS.</p>\n\t\n    \n</section></div>\n          \n\n        \n        \n        \n         \n        \n                 \n        \n        \n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 221px;\">\n        \t\t\n<section class=\"gc-drmt\"><h2 data-emptytext=\"Enter heading\" class=\"h5\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/en/security-intelligence-service/corporate/reporting-national-security-information.html\">Reporting National Security Information</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<p>Report threats to national security.</p>\n\t\n    \n</section></div>\n          \n\n        \n        \n        \n         \n        \n                 \n        \n        \n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 221px;\">\n        \t\t\n<section class=\"gc-drmt\"><h2 data-emptytext=\"Enter heading\" class=\"h5\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/defence/nationalsecurity.html\">National security</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<p>Keeping Canadians safe through counter-terrorism, security screening and protecting critical infrastructure.</p>\n\t\n    \n</section></div>\n          \n\n        \n        \n        \n         \n        \n                 \n        \n        \n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 525px;\">\n        \t\t